BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Social
DESCRIPTION:Escape campus for the day and experience immersive digital art
  at ARTECHOUSE New York with fellow MSU students! Explore interactive exh
 ibits\, stunning projections\, and futuristic installations throughout th
 e museum. After the exhibit\, students will have one hour of free time to
  grab dinner before returning to the bus. Your ticket includes general ad
 mission to the museum and round-trip transportation to and from New York 
 City. This trip is exclusively for currently enrolled MSU students\, and 
 all students must return to the designated bus meeting location at the as
 signed time for departure back to campus. Spots are limited to 50 student
 s and tickets will be available on a first come\, first served basis. Don
 ’t miss out!\n \n!!Tickets Go on Sale October 14th at 10am!!\n \nHow do I
  Sign-up?\n\nRegister here\, or in the Student Rec Center main office\, o
 r over the phone (973-655-3340).\n$25 for students with a valid Montclair
  State ID\n\nWhere and When?\n\nSaturday\, November 14\, 2026\n1:00 p.m. 
 (Bus leaves from SRC at 11:30 a.m.) - 4:00 p.m.\nTransportation will be p
 rovided and will start from the Student Recreation Center.  Arte Museum T
 our is at 61 Chelsea Piers\, New York\, NY 10011\n\n\nHosted by: Campus R
 ecreation\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.ca
 mpuslabs.com/engage/event/12738377
DTEND:20261114T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T061455Z
DTSTART:20261114T180000Z
LOCATION:Transportation will be provided and will start from SRC to 61 Che
 lsea Piers\, New York\, NY 10011
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Arte Museum Tour
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12738377
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12738377
X-HOSTS:Campus Recreation
END:VEVENT
