DESCRIPTION:Behind the Scenes of Nature Conservation! \nEver wondered what
  it takes to run a nature center? Join the Environmental Club for a speci
 al guest speaker event featuring the Executive Director of Flat Rock Broo
 k Nature Center in Englewood\, NJ! \nLearn about the director’s leadershi
 p in environmental education\, wildlife conservation\, and protecting loc
 al ecosystems. Discover what goes into managing a nature preserve\, the c
 hallenges of conservation\, and exciting career opportunities in the envi
 ronmental field. Don't miss this chance to hear firsthand experiences\, a
 sk questions\, and get inspired to make a difference! Stephen Wiessner ha
 s served as Executive Director since 2006\, bringing 20 years of leadersh
 ip to Flat Rock Brook.\n\nHosted by: Environmental Club\n\nAdditional Inf
 ormation can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/1
 2978510
