DESCRIPTION:Never swam before? No problem! These lessons will give you the
  important foundational skills in swimming and help you be more comfortab
 le in the pool. Learn how to use proper breath control\, float\, and swim
  with a kickboard. \n \nSkills Focus:\n\nBeing comfortable in the water\n
 Learning how to float on your back and front\nLearning how to kick off th
 e wall with a kickboard\nIntroducing proper breath control in the water\n
 Learning how to tread water\nLearn alternate kicks (Froggy Kick)\nBeing c
 omfortable in the deep end \nIntroducing arms to your strokes\n\n\nHow do
  I Sign-up?\n\nRegistration is not required\nFREE with a valid Montclair 
 State ID\n\n \nWhen and Where?\n\nStudent Recreation Center - Pool \n\n\n
 Hosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: h
