 \, and resume development. Participants will learn how to use AI platform
 s to design\, edit\, and tailor resumes while strategically presenting th
 eir skills and experiences. Discover how AI can help you tell your profes
 sional story with clarity\, creativity\, and confidence— so you can stand
  out in a rapidly evolving career landscape.\n\nHosted by: The ADP Center
 \n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.
 com/engage/event/12714243
