DESCRIPTION:Pre-Law Society’s newest sub-committee: Pre-Law Review! \nA ne
 w student-run journal that aims to give Montclair State University Studen
 ts the opportunity to explore current and historical legal issues through
  legal research\, writing\, and analysis. Members will work collaborative
 ly  to research cases\, statutes\, and scholarly sources\, develop legal 
