DESCRIPTION:Are you a graduate student working on a journal article for pu
 blication? Learn more about the Grad Student Journal Article Writing Grou
 p!\nThis writing group will run over 13 weeks during the Spring semester 
 (January - April 2027)\, with a week off in March. Weekly topics will inc
 lude: publication venues\, selecting a journal\, writing your argument\, 
 literature review\, citation management and more. We will use Wendy Laura
  Belcher’s Writing Your Journal Article in Twelve Weeks to guide the disc
 ussions and work. \nRegister to attend this Zoom information session wher
 e we will discuss how the program will run\, the expected time commitment
 \, and answer any other questions you may have. Please contact cwe@montcl
 air.edu with any questions. A limited number of seats are available.\nSpo
 nsored by the Center for Writing Excellence and the University Libraries.
 \nRegister Here: https://montclair.libcal.com/event/17747787\n\nHosted by
 : Sprague Library\n\nOnline Location: https://montclair.libcal.com/event/
 17747787\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.cam
 puslabs.com/engage/event/12884889
