BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:CommunityService
DESCRIPTION:This November\, every event is giving back. We’re partnering w
 ith Toni’s Kitchen to help support local families in need through a month
 -long nonperishable food drive. Students are encouraged to bring canned g
 oods and other nonperishable items to every event or at any convenience t
 hroughout the month. Every donation you make will get you a raffle ticket
  and the raffle will be drawn on the 19th of November and winners will be
  emailed.  At the end of November\, all donations will be collected and d
 onated to Toni’s Kitchen. Students have the option at the end of that sam
 e week to come to Toni’s Kitchen and sort the food we collected\, for add
 itional community service hours. Every item makes a difference\, so come 
 out\, have fun\, and help support our community at the same time.\nCollec
 t throughout the month of November\, final collection at Flea Market \n \
 nHow do I sign-up?\n\nFree with Student ID\nNo cost\, no registration!\n\
 nWhere and when?\n\nTuesday\, November 16th - 20th\, 2026\nTime: Anytime 
 of event\nStudent Recreation Center\n\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\n
 Additional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/
 engage/event/12844775
