DESCRIPTION:Welcome Back!\nOur weekly NAACP discussion space is dedicated 
 to education\, empowerment\, and collective action. Each Monday from 2:00
  PM – 3:15 PM\, we gather to engage in meaningful conversations surroundi
 ng civil rights\, social justice\, advocacy\, and current events impactin
 g Black communities on campus and beyond.\nEach week brings something new
  — current events\, culture\, advocacy topics\, campus concerns\, or what
 ever’s on our minds. Come through\, share your voice\, and be part of a c
 ommunity that’s always growing and always pushing forward.\n\nHosted by: 
 National Association for the Advancement of Colored People\n\nAdditional 
 Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/even
 t/12713136
