DESCRIPTION:Whether you're someone with a food allergy or know someone wit
 h one\, this presentation will be extra beneficial for you to navigate fo
 od during the holiday season. Registered dietitian Eva Weston will be com
 ing in to speak about her career path and how she got into her specialty.
  She'll also be touching on adverse food reactions\, such as allergies an
 d intolerances\, and she will be talking about the diagnosis\, interventi
 on\, and management aspect of her job. If this sounds like something you'
 d be interested in\, drop by! \n \n\nHosted by: Dietetics Organization\n\
