DESCRIPTION:Join All Pockets Full for our in-person General Body Meeting a
 t Montclair State University. This meeting is an opportunity to connect w
 ith other students who are interested in business\, finance\, entrepreneu
 rship\, personal growth\, and building a stronger future. We’ll have real
  conversations\, interactive discussions\, and activities designed to hel
 p you learn\, connect\, and grow. Whether you already have experience in 
 finance or business or you’re simply curious and looking to learn more\, 
 everyone is welcome. Come meet the All Pockets Full team\, connect with l
 ike-minded students\, share your ideas\, and learn something you can take
  with you beyond the meeting. No specific major or experience is required
