DESCRIPTION:Philosophy for Lunch - “Burnout Society”Dec. 3 Philosophy for 
 Lunch - “Burnout Society” 12PM–1PM\, Dickson Hall\, Cohen Lounge (Room 17
 8)\nWHAT IS PHILOSOPHY FOR LUNCH? Philosophy for Lunch is a weekly event 
 at which students\, professors\, and other philosophy enthusiasts close-r
 ead and discuss great passages of philosophy. The themes are different ea
 ch week. No preparation or previous knowledge of philosophy is needed. Ev
 eryone is welcome! Bring a beverage\, and if you’re hungry\, bring your a
 ctual lunch.\n\nHosted by: College of Humanities and Social Sciences (CHS
 S)\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslab
 s.com/engage/event/12980529
