CATEGORIES:Academic/Educational/Intellectual
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an inspiring virtual conversation designed for His
 panic/Latino and Spanish-speaking students pursuing careers in healthcare
 \, as well as students enrolled in the Spanish for Health Professionals C
 ertificate.\nOur guest physicians will share how their language\, cultura
 l heritage\, and personal experiences have shaped their medical careers\,
  offering valuable insights\, advice\, and encouragement to future health
 care professionals.\nDr. Luis Espina is a bilingual\, board-certified fam
 ily medicine physician with a background in biomedical engineering.\nDr. 
 Alfred Quezada is a board-certified internist and hospitalist at Clara Ma
 ass Medical Center with over 20 years of experience.\n\nHosted by: Associ
 ation of Latino Professionals For America\, Center for Latino Heritage & 
 Spanish Language Excellence\, Montclair Pre-Medical Club\, Medical Case &
  Diagnostics Club \, Pre-Medical Program\, The Latino Medical Student Ass
 ociation PLUS\n\nOnline Location: https://montclair.zoom.us/j/93787115379
 \n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.
 com/engage/event/12976854
