DESCRIPTION:Be a Buddy at the Rec! Volunteer for Friends Day on Sunday\, D
 ecember 6 at the Student Recreation Center. As a Buddy\, you and another 
 MSU student will be paired with a child or young adult to go station-to-s
 tation\, participate in fun activities and crafts\, and help them explore
  and enjoy the space. You can sign up for one or both sessions\, and comm
 unity service hours will be given. \nWant to volunteer with a friend? Gre
 at! Buddies can sign up together as long as you're both MSU students. Thi
 s year’s theme is Lilo & Stitch\, so get ready for a fun-filled day inspi
 red by your favorite characters and shows. Come make a meaningful impact 
 while having fun! \n \nHow do I sign-up?\n\nTo register\, please fill out
  this form. \nVisit our Friends Day website for more information.\n\nWher
 e and when?\n\nSunday\, December 6\, 2026\n10am – 12pm and/or 2 – 4pm\nSt
 udent Recreation Center\n\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional I
 nformation can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event
 /12801358
