DESCRIPTION:Register Your Child for Friends Day! Friends Day is a fun\, in
 clusive event at the MSU Student Recreation Center for individuals with d
 isabilities\, ages 5–21. Your child will be paired with two MSU student B
 uddies and guided through a variety of exciting activity stations—includi
 ng games\, crafts\, and more—all designed to promote creativity\, movemen
 t\, and fun in a supportive environment. \nFriends Day takes place on Sun
 day\, December 6\, and you may register your child for one session only—e
 ither the morning or afternoon session. Don’t miss this exciting opportun
